+
+- Ride toward an objective with a visible hostile player entering 50 yards.
+  The bot must cancel the objective path, dismount immediately, select that
+  player and switch its AI engine to combat without riding into melee first.
+- Keep an unrelated hostile player nearby without targeting or attacking the
+  bot. It must not become a movement threat by proximity alone unless it enters
+  the eight-yard emergency radius. Its actively attacking pet still counts.
+- In the BG danger band, verify one continuous retreat spline while instant
+  attacks and class control continue in the same decision cycle. Only the
+  emergency band may consume the movement tick ahead of kill pressure.
+- Lower the primary target below 30% while pressure remains outside emergency
+  range. The bot must plant for the kill instead of continuing an ordinary
+  danger retreat.
+- While BG combat ownership is active, repeatedly trigger objective updates and
+  mount checks. Neither may replace the combat spline. After the target is gone
+  and combat has been clear for 2.5 seconds, objective travel and mounting must
+  resume.
